Comprehensive Prompt for Coding LLM: Build a Complete CRM System
Project Overview
Build a complete, production-ready Customer Relationship Management (CRM) system that implements the full marketing-to-sales lifecycle, similar to Salesforce, HubSpot, or Microsoft Dynamics 365. The system should handle lead capture, marketing automation, sales pipeline management, and customer relationship tracking.

Technical Stack Requirements
Backend
* Framework: Node.js with Express.js OR Python with Django/Flask OR Ruby on Rails
* Database: PostgreSQL (preferred) or MySQL
* ORM: Sequelize (Node.js), SQLAlchemy (Python), or ActiveRecord (Rails)
* API: RESTful API architecture with comprehensive endpoints
* Authentication: JWT-based authentication with role-based access control (RBAC)
* Email Service: Integration with SendGrid, AWS SES, or similar
* Job Queue: Bull (Node.js) or Celery (Python) for background jobs
* Cache: Redis for caching and session management
Frontend
* Framework: React with TypeScript OR Vue.js 3 OR Next.js
* State Management: Redux Toolkit, Zustand, or Pinia (Vue)
* UI Components: Material-UI, Ant Design, or Tailwind CSS with Headless UI
* Forms: React Hook Form or Formik with Yup validation
* Charts: Chart.js, Recharts, or D3.js for analytics dashboards
* Drag-and-Drop: React DnD or Vue Draggable for Kanban pipeline views
* Rich Text Editor: TipTap or Quill for email templates and notes
Additional Services
* File Storage: AWS S3, Google Cloud Storage, or local storage with multer
* Real-time Updates: Socket.io or WebSockets for live notifications
* Search: Elasticsearch (optional but recommended for large datasets)
* Testing: Jest, Mocha, or Pytest with comprehensive test coverage

